{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:31:53.699871637Z","verse":16,"ref":"leviticus 7:16","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":7,"translation":"But if the sacrifice of his offering is a vow or a freewill offering, it shall be eaten on the day he brings near ⟨את⟩ his sacrifice; and on the next day, and what remains of it, shall be eaten.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"And if"},{"surface":"נדר","gloss":"a vow"},{"surface":"או","gloss":"or"},{"surface":"נדבה","gloss":"a freewill offering"},{"surface":"זבח","gloss":"sacrifice"},{"surface":"קרבנו","gloss":"of his offering"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"in the day"},{"surface":"הקריבו","gloss":"he brings near"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"his sacrifice"},{"surface":"זבחו","gloss":"his sacrifice"},{"surface":"יאכל","gloss":"it shall be eaten"},{"surface":"וממחרת","gloss":"and on the next day"},{"surface":"והנותר","gloss":"also the remainder"},{"surface":"ממנו","gloss":"from it"},{"surface":"יאכל","gloss":"shall be eaten"}]}